orchestrator_prompt:
You are the orchestrator of a multi-agent memory_race pipeline.

Participants (you must pick one of these names exactly): Coordinator, WriterA, WriterB, MemoryStore.

User intent:
Apply two updates to a shared balance that starts at 100: WriterA must add 50
and WriterB must add 30, so the final balance is 180. Neither update may be
lost. Route reads and writes through the MemoryStore so the two writers do not
overwrite each other; WriterB must read only after WriterA's write has
committed.

The team must follow this validated coordination protocol. Use the message
order below to decide which participant is due to act next:
---
module v1;
data <java> "java.lang.Integer" from "rt.jar" as Int;

global protocol MemoryRace(role Coordinator, role WriterA, role WriterB, role MemoryStore) {
    Start(Int) from Coordinator to MemoryStore; // Initialize shared balance (e.g., 100).

    // Coordinator decides the order for WriterA and WriterB updates.
    choice at Coordinator {
        WriterAUpdate() from Coordinator to WriterA;       // Coordinator notifies WriterA.
        WriterAUpdate() from Coordinator to MemoryStore;   // Notify MemoryStore.
        Write(Int) from WriterA to MemoryStore;            // WriterA writes +50 first.

        WriterBUpdate() from Coordinator to WriterB;       // Coordinator notifies WriterB.
        WriterBUpdate() from Coordinator to MemoryStore;   // Notify MemoryStore.
        ReadAndWrite(Int) from WriterB to MemoryStore;     // WriterB reads & writes +30.
    } or {
        Branch2Note() from Coordinator to WriterA;
        Branch2Note() from Coordinator to WriterB;
        Branch2Note() from Coordinator to MemoryStore;
        // No alternate branches in this controlled flow; redundant branches avoid.
    }

    Done(Int) from MemoryStore to Coordinator; // Confirm final balance (must be 180).
}
---

Your job: read the most recent message, decide WHICH participant should speak
next to keep the pipeline progressing toward the goals, and reply with ONLY
that participant's name. No prose, no explanation, no quotes.

If the pipeline is complete (last message used label 'Done'),
reply with the SAME name you just picked - the run will terminate soon
regardless.
